Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.97,0:00:05.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,Three friends, one deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:08.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,The pizza is twenty-five minutes out, and they want a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.63,0:00:10.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,game before it lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.45,0:00:13.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,Talk2Build sits in the meeting, with Alexa plus as its voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.04,0:00:18.47,Cap,,0,0,0,,Maya says the goal out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.22,0:00:19.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,Nobody types a command.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.03,0:00:22.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,A plan card appears, and the decision and action items
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.64,0:00:24.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,are saved under her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.07,0:00:28.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,Chris sketches the architecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.29,0:00:30.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,Priya asks for the game screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.44,0:00:33.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,Both land on the shared stage while they are still talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.10,0:00:42.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then the classic argument: Phaser or PixiJS?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.73,0:00:44.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,This card is live.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.34,0:00:48.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Real GitHub and npm numbers, each with its source.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.65,0:00:49.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,Talk2Build recommends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.33,0:00:53.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,The humans decide: plain canvas, zero dependencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.14,0:00:59.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,Is the pizza here yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.70,0:01:00.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,Small talk gets parked.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.59,0:01:02.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,It stays out of the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.67,0:01:08.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,A feasibility card for phones: plain canvas works, as
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.08,0:01:09.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,long as it gets touch controls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.20,0:01:14.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,Chris asks for the build.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.93,0:01:17.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,Anything that writes code waits for a human yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.97,0:01:18.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Maya says yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.25,0:01:20.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,Talk2Build writes a spec from the meeting's decisions,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.56,0:01:24.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,scaffolds the prototype from its game-jam template, and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.21,0:01:26.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,runs the tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.92,0:01:26.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,Seven of seven pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.24,0:01:34.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,And here it is, playable right inside the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.24,0:01:35.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,Space Cat Courier.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.12,0:01:38.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Dodge the asteroids, grab pizza for fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.15,0:01:41.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,Every ten parcels, the asteroids speed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.27,0:01:55.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then the real pizza arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.84,0:01:55.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,Parked, naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.30,0:02:00.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,End the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.82,0:02:03.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,The minutes, the spec, the designs and the prototype
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.90,0:02:04.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,stay in the workspace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.44,0:02:12.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,Under the hood, Alexa plus talks to a self-hosted MCP
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.78,0:02:16.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,server over Streamable HTTP, and the tools do the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.77,0:02:19.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,This demo runs in mock mode, on recorded fixtures.
